---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="How do scoring and levels work?">
  <style is:global>
    .doc-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      padding: 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      color: #1a1a1a;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }
    .doc-card h1 {
      color: #2e7d32;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #a5d6a7;
      padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    .doc-card h2 {
      color: #388e3c;
      margin-top: 1.8rem;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
    .doc-card p, .doc-card li {
      color: #1a1a1a;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .doc-card a {
      color: #1a73e8;
    }
    .doc-card .highlight {
      background-color: #fff3e0;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-left: 6px solid #ff9800;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    .doc-card hr {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
    }
    .doc-card ul {
      margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 1.5rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .doc-card { padding: 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>

  <div class="doc-card">
    <h1>How do scoring and levels work?</h1>
    <p>In the <strong>Score/Level</strong> section you can see all your activity as a fan. Every time you attend a match and complete the events that take place, you earn points that allow you to level up and unlock badges.</p>

    <hr>

    <h2>📊 How is your score calculated?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Match attendance:</strong> You will receive points for each match you attend. The score is counted when the match has started the second half or when you complete any event within the match.</li>
      <li><strong>Support events (songs):</strong> To complete a support event, such as singing the team anthem, you must play the song for at least 20 seconds. This will give you bonus points.</li>
      <li><strong>Knowledge events (quizzes):</strong> By correctly answering quiz questions, and the faster you do it, the more points you will get.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>🏅 Levels and badges</h2>
    <p>As you accumulate points, you will level up. Each level has a different name and icon. Additionally, you can earn special badges by reaching certain milestones (e.g., attending 10 matches, singing 20 songs, etc.). In the <em>Badges</em> tab you can see your progress towards each of them.</p>

    <h2>📈 Ranking</h2>
    <p>In the <em>Ranking</em> tab you can compare your score with other fans of your team. Only the top 50 per team are shown to encourage healthy competition.</p>

    <p>Remember, the more you participate, the more points you earn and the higher you will climb in the ranking! Keep cheering for your team!</p>
  </div>
</Layout>